      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Fable 5.2, Anthropic&rsquo;s newest Fable model, is now generally available in GitHub Copilot.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In early testing, Fable 5.2 solved more tasks than Claude Fable 5.1 while using fewer steps and tool calls.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Fable 5.2 requires data retention by default to operate Anthropic&rsquo;s safety classifiers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Fable 5.2 is available to Copilot Pro+, Max, Business, and Enterprise users.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot Enterprise and Copilot Business plan administrators must enable the Claude Fable 5.2 policy in Copilot settings.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Fable 5.2 requires data retention by default.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When Claude Fable 5.2 is used, Anthropic retains data, including prompts and outputs, to operate safety classifiers that detect harmful use.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Other Claude models, except for Fable 5, Fable 5.1, and Fable 5.2, continue to operate under zero data retention (ZDR).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Eligible customers can use Claude Fable 5.2, Claude Fable 5.1, and Claude Fable 5 with zero data retention through the end of the calendar year under a time-bound exemption while Anthropic rolls out Enterprise Frontier Safeguards (EFS).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If your enterprise is approved for access, Claude Fable 5.2, Fable 5.1, and Fable 5 requests will be routed to zero data retention endpoints when the model is enabled.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T16:46:43.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:38.261Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "After approval, a Copilot Enterprise or Copilot Business administrator must still enable the Claude Fable 5.2 policy in Copilot settings.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-09-claude-fable-5-2-in-github-copilot",
